    {
      "name": "AI_Shade_State0A_GrappleRetractAndComplete",
      "start": "0x01341A",
      "end": "0x0134DE",
      "size_bytes": 196,
      "instruction_count": 51,
      "sub_entry_points": {
        "state_0a_entry": "0x01341A",
        "retract_complete": "0x01348E"
      },
      "description": "Clears Ali velocity +$72/+$76(a5), decrements +$02(a6) (<=0 -> 0x01348E). When +$AA==0, checks 0x00E398 Manhattan distance d5 <= $10 (16px -> 0x01348E). Accelerates +$4E/+$52 by (0x60, 0x60) via 0x00E2D4: if +$AA==0 adds to Shade +$72/+$76; if 0<+$AA<$FF2954 subtracts from +$AE/+$B2 and syncs Ali via 0x01352A; if +$AA>=$FF2954 adds to Shade +$72/+$76 and drags item via 0x013550. At 0x01348E: runs 0x009D00 on entity or snaps item +$08/+$0C to Ali, clears $FF1982, unlocks +$38(a5) bit 3 and $FF17B8 bit 2, frees tether slot +$A6 if +$00==$FFFF, and branches to 0x01378A."
    },
    {
      "name": "AI_Shade_GrappleTetherAnchorAndDragHelpers",
      "start": "0x0134DE",
      "end": "0x013576",
      "size_bytes": 152,
      "instruction_count": 41,
      "sub_entry_points": {
        "tether_anchor_lock": "0x0134DE",
        "sync_ali_to_target": "0x01352A",
        "drag_item_to_tip": "0x013550"
      },
      "description": "0x0134DE returns if +$AA==0 or jumps to 0x013550 if +$AA>=$FF2954; else tests +$17(a5) bit 0 (horizontal vs vertical Ali facing) to lock +$AE/+$B2 along the grapple axis and align both Shade and Ali perpendicular coords onto the target. 0x01352A (or -> 0x013550 if >=$FF2954) keeps Ali at target + (+$AE, +$B2). 0x013550 skips if +$32<$15 (21), else calls 0x013622 and places item at (shade_x + dx, shade_y + dy - shade_z)."
    },
    {
      "name": "AI_Shade_UpdateTetherStretchEntity",
      "start": "0x013576",
      "end": "0x013608",
      "size_bytes": 146,
      "instruction_count": 42,
      "sub_entry_points": {
        "tether_stretch_callback": "0x013576"
      },
      "description": "Tether sub-entity callback: despawns (+$00=0) if parent +$A6 type != $001C; skips render (returns without despawning) if parent +$36 bit 1 is set (low-SP blink). Computes Chebyshev max(|ali_x - shade_x|, |ali_y - (shade_y - shade_z)|) using $FF19E8 & $FF1AA4; if > $14 (20px), computes idx = min((dist - 20) >> 3, 11), sets +$32(a6) = $60 + idx*3, copies Shade (x, y, z_fixed), calls 0x00B022, and clears 32-bit +$0C(a6)."
    },
    {
      "name": "AI_Shade_ProbeItemsAtGrappleTip",
      "start": "0x013608",
      "end": "0x01366A",
      "size_bytes": 98,
      "instruction_count": 25,
      "sub_entry_points": {
        "probe_items_at_tip": "0x013608",
        "lookup_tip_offset": "0x013622",
        "shade_grapple_tip_offset_table": "0x013652"
      },
      "description": "0x013608 calls 0x013622, expands [dx-4..dx+4, dy-4..dy+4, z=0], and jumps to 0x00B9EC item pool scanner. 0x013622 selects tier 0 (+$32 <= $17), tier 1 (+$32 <= $1A), or tier 2 (+$32 > $1A) from inline 24-byte ShadeGrappleTipOffsetTable at 0x013652..0x01366A and sign-extends (dx, dy) for facing +$16(a6) in 0..3.",
      "code_end": "0x013652",
